Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: Continuous attributable development history
Dependencies: None
Purpose: Preserve cross-workstream actions, effects, reasoning and evidence.

Tasks:
  [ ] Append an entry at meaningful completed or blocked milestones.
  [ ] Keep historical failures and superseded decisions traceable.

Acceptance criteria:
  Entries distinguish actual actions from proposals.
  Claims link to source/workstream/artifact evidence.
  Private context, raw transcripts and secrets are not copied here.
  An ongoing ledger is not marked DONE merely because one task finished.

Completion evidence:
  <actual entry IDs/dates and linked receipts>

Completion log:
  <date> - <workstream ID>
    Action: <what actually changed>
    Immediate effect: <what was observed>
    Reason: <why this action was selected>
    Mechanism: <how it produced the effect>
    Evidence: <source/test/artifact>
    Limits/next consequence: <what remains or follows>
